  "name": "chimpanzee",
  "_about": "THE CHIMPANZEE (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/bigmam/chimpanzee.py, written whole on its own rig in its standing pose): a common chimpanzee male, ~0.8 m at the shoulder on all fours. Lean -- the back sloping evenly from the shoulders, no gorilla's hump or barrel; long black-haired arms, KNUCKLE-WALKING on fingers curled under; longer legs than a gorilla's, an ape's foot with the great toe apart. A smaller head with a flat crown, a jutting brow bar, the long PROTRUDING muzzle with a deep mobile upper lip and a small flat nose; BIG round ears standing out; the face BARE and light, side-whiskers framing it, a pale chin tuft. Coats: the adult (pinkish-grey-brown face), the young (pale face, white chin tuft), an old male's darkened face, the dark-faced.",
